    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The most powerful. \nThe strength of the king comes from his queen.\nHer
    silence is measured in casualties, after all, it's kill or be killed.\n\u201CWhen
    the last move is made, I will not be here to see it.\u201D\n"
